@startuml AttendanceMonitoringSystemSequenceDiagramViewReport
title Sequence Diagram - View Attendance Report (FR10)

actor Tutor
participant "Report Screen (UI)" as UI
participant "AttendanceReportService" as Service
participant "Database" as DB

Tutor -> UI : Select student
Tutor -> UI : Request Individual Student\nAttendance Report

UI -> Service : GetStudentReport(studentId, moduleId)

Service -> DB : Check TutorSession exists for\nTutor and any session in this module
DB --> Service : Authorisation result

alt Tutor not authorised
    Service --> UI : Access denied
    UI --> Tutor : Show error "Not authorised"
else Tutor authorised
    Service -> DB : Read Attendance records\nfor student and module
    DB --> Service : Attendance records

    Service -> DB : Read correction count and\nmost recent correction date
    DB --> Service : Correction summary

    Service -> Service : Calculate status totals,\nscheduled sessions,\npercentage (BR20),\ncompliance (BR14)

    Service --> UI : AttendanceReport
    UI --> Tutor : Display report\n(status totals, percentage,\ncompliance, correction summary)
end

@enduml